OL,3,GNEWSAWhen can I board a tram in Dudley?
OL,4,
OL,5,FTrams are being tested on the new
OL,6,FDudley extension of the West Midlands
OL,7,FMetro network as the long-awaited
OL,8,Fscheme that has been beset with delays
OL,9,Fcomes to fruition.
OL,11,FOver the next few weeks, trams will
OL,12,Fbecome an increasingly common sight
OL,13,Falong the line between Wednesbury and
OL,14,FDudley, transport bosses said, as part
OL,15,Fof driver training.
OL,17,FPedestrians and drivers are being
OL,18,Fadvised by West Midlands Metro to look
OL,19,Fout for the trams on the new route as
OL,20,Ftests continue.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
